Let's examine actions related to transport leg:

- transport_leg_available ?transport_leg
- transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg
- transport_leg_origin_linked ?transport_leg ?origin_node
- transport_leg_destination_linked ?transport_leg ?destination_node
- origin_leg_loaded ?transport_leg
- destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg
- transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg

Actions:

(:action assemble_transport_leg
    :parameters (?transport_leg - transport_leg ?origin_node - origin_node ?destination_node - destination_node)
    :precondition
      (and
        (transport_leg_available ?transport_leg)
        (origin_node_ready ?origin_node)
        (destination_node_ready ?destination_node)
        (not
          (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg)
        )
        (not
          (origin_node_occupied ?origin_node)
        )
        (not
          (destination_node_occupied ?destination_node)
        )
      )
    :effect
      (and
        (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg)
        (transport_leg_origin_linked ?transport_leg ?origin_node)
        (transport_leg_destination_linked ?transport_leg ?destination_node)
        (not
          (transport_leg_available ?transport_leg)
        )
        (not
          (origin_node_ready ?origin_node)
        )
        (not
          (destination_node_ready ?destination_node)
        )
      )
)

Thus to assemble transport leg, we need origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready, and nodes not occupied. After assembling, nodes become not ready (they lose ready) and leg becomes assembled and linked.

Then we have actions to load origin leg and destination leg:

(:action load_origin_leg
    :parameters (?transport_leg - transport_leg ?origin_node - origin_node ?loading_container - loading_container)
    :precondition
      (and
        (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg)
        (transport_leg_origin_linked ?transport_leg ?origin_node)
        (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        (not
          (origin_leg_loaded ?transport_leg)
        )
        (not
          (origin_node_occupied ?origin_node)
        )
      )
    :effect
      (and
        (origin_leg_loaded ?transport_leg)
        (loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg)
        (origin_node_occupied ?origin_node)
        (not
          (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        )
      )
)

(:action load_destination_leg
    :parameters (?transport_leg - transport_leg ?destination_node - destination_node ?loading_container - loading_container)
    :precondition
      (and
        (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg)
        (transport_leg_destination_linked ?transport_leg ?destination_node)
        (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        (not
          (destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg)
        )
        (not
          (destination_node_occupied ?destination_node)
        )
      )
    :effect
      (and
        (destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg)
        (loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg)
        (destination_node_occupied ?destination_node)
        (not
          (loading_container_available ?loading_container)
        )
      )
)

